sequenceDiagram
    actor O as Operator
    participant API as Canonical Operations API
    participant A as Authority/Pipeline
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant R as Runner
    participant GH as GitHub API
    participant V as Independent Verifier

    O->>API: POST /operations/{request_id}/read + Idempotency-Key
    API->>A: authorize and prepare READ
    A->>DB: snapshot + grant + consumption + outbox/inbox + lease
    DB-->>A: durable admission
    A->>R: activate bounded READ
    R->>GH: provider READ with Runner credential
    GH-->>R: observed provider state
    R->>DB: durable execution/completion evidence
    R-->>V: expected/runner observation context
    V->>GH: independent READ with Verifier credential
    GH-->>V: authoritative readback
    V-->>API: VerificationResult/v1
    API-->>O: READ response + verification result

    Note over API,DB: Durable VerificationResult projection is not currently proven/stored by passport.
    Note over O,V: Live default-pack HTTP E2E has workflow code but no observed acceptance run.
